{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/226972-nemian-beasts","id":226972,"title":"Nemian Beasts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-13T06:39:48-07:00","id":226972,"title":"Nemian Beasts","content":"SO if I understand the entry right Nemian is a template that can add to any critterat all? because my group was discussing the weirder ones that could exist and if insects/bugs are fair game. So for example with the amount of strength increase a nemian ant hive would be like a silent wolfswarm in effect right? Also we decided on a ban of all parasites after the idea of a nemian tapeworm was brought up, but I was hoping to hear some of your ideas on ones that were good or bad ideas to make.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2135-disodium-benzoate","name":"DIsodium Benzoate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T06:47:41-07:00","id":226984,"title":"","content":"I horribly abused the Nemian template in order to create a race of two-headed dogs for my game.<br /> <br /> People seem to enjoy them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T06:04:57-07:00","id":230116,"title":"","content":"Giant insect/bugs are always creepy and fun in a fight. The point is you can do anything as long as it fits your game.<br /> Don't forget that nemean beast get bigger and parasite are less effective if they can't enter the body of their target and insect/bugs are less discreet if they are the size of a crow or a snake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2799-astoril","name":"Astoril","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2799_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T06:33:56-07:00","id":230132,"title":"","content":"Now there's something...a parasite as big as a house cat would have me wondering...and looking up...and up...o shit","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T02:29:39-07:00","id":272123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astoril</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/226972-nemian-beasts?p=230116#post230116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Giant insect/bugs are always creepy and fun in a fight. The point is you can do anything as long as it fits your game.<br /> Don't forget that nemean beast get bigger and parasite are less effective if they can't enter the body of their target and insect/bugs are less discreet if they are the size of a crow or a snake.</div> </div> </div> </div>What if that parasite sucks all your insides out in one long slurp, then moves onto its next target?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T09:44:18-07:00","id":272306,"title":"","content":"We had Nemean mosquito/blow-fly/flying tick bugs the heroes had to fight on top of the Hoover Dam. The bugs would plunge in their proboscis into their victims, sucking out all the juices and some of the softer bits, which would cause their abdomens to swell up. After a couple of meals, the abdomen would drop off as an almost ready to hatch pupae with another thin hungry bug inside. Meanwhile, 'mama' would now be a thin hungry bug as well and would be out there sucking the juicy bits out of someone else.<br /> <br /> The fireman Scion of Atar, who was normally VERY careful about setting fires (much to his daddy's disappointment) went completely bonkers like a human flamethrower and the Celestial Bureaucracy martial arts movie star got very creative with his Sky boons and some on the spot alchemy to create poison gas. It worked, but they found out the Grand Canyon was infested with these things and they were spreading. They had to go stop an Avatar of the Animal Titan from manifesting and start humanity devolving into proto-human cannibals, so they never got around to going to back to figure what the hell was causing the problem before the game had to end.<br /> <br /> Sad. I loved those little bugs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T15:05:50-07:00","id":272518,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Neman Bugs<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20120928005340/fallout/images/d/d4/Specimen_73.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T15:17:36-07:00","id":272526,"title":"","content":"KILL IT WITH SNIPER ROUNDS!!<br /> <br /> <br /> Where is Boon!?<br /> <br /> <br /> Hmm, what if Boon was a Scion of hunting, or a guardian? Makes sense with how good he was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-ny